libminizinc: MiniZinc is a free and open-source constraint modelling language.
libminizinc: It can model constraint satisfaction and optimization problems in
libminizinc: a high-level, solver-independent way, and compiles them to
libminizinc: FlatZinc for a wide range of solvers (Gecode, OR-Tools, HiGHS...).
